{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884940/extras/364f24527a0b0af9278da9e979c7155c.avif?t=1767202961\" alt=\"NUMBER DUNGEON\" width=614 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884940/extras/c42d2a5d33fcbd974da0ff650baf7226.poster.avif?t=1767202961\" width=614 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884940/extras/c42d2a5d33fcbd974da0ff650baf7226.webm?t=1767202961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884940/extras/c42d2a5d33fcbd974da0ff650baf7226.mp4?t=1767202961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Welcome to the dungeon!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the tabletop card game Scoundrel Solitaire, Number Dungeon does away with the four suits, and in its place has dozens upon dozens of potential encounters incorporating the monster-item-weapon formula. Strategy is key in this numbers game - know which move is the best at any given time to clear any dungeon you face!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884940/extras/4713aa140a8d15ef96e0cf1c223fca0a.avif?t=1767202961\" alt=\"DUNGEONS A PLENTY\" width=614 height=80 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Strategize to succeed!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See if you can clear set &quot;decks&quot;, holding true to this game's Scoundrel Solitaire roots. First take on a recreation of the classic, then take on more advanced decks that twist the core gameplay loop more and more with each successive challenge. With both a linear set of dungeons and a couple of hidden challenges, can you clear them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884940/extras/c20d1b4756591a07d35d1ecccc5cd7ef.avif?t=1767202961\" alt=\"THE GAUNTLET\" width=614 height=80 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Take on the eternal!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills in a randomly generated dungeon that never ends with over<strong>\u00a0140\u00a0</strong>different boons and banes to encounter. Try to clear as many encounters as you can before your health hits 0, with high scores, a seed system, different zones to uncover, and many rare secrets only in this mode!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3884940?t=1767202961","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884940/7027c813aede6f09d8303a26028263514e4e04c5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767202961","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884940/55f62b1a274ee94f84331fe47cbc90a80f30d85e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767202961","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884940/55f62b1a274ee94f84331fe47cbc90a80f30d85e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767202961","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884940/extras/364f24527a0b0af9278da9e979c7155c.avif?t=1767202961\" alt=\"NUMBER DUNGEON\" width=614 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884940/extras/c42d2a5d33fcbd974da0ff650baf7226.poster.avif?t=1767202961\" width=614 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884940/extras/c42d2a5d33fcbd974da0ff650baf7226.webm?t=1767202961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884940/extras/c42d2a5d33fcbd974da0ff650baf7226.mp4?t=1767202961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Welcome to the dungeon!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the tabletop card game Scoundrel Solitaire, Number Dungeon does away with the four suits, and in its place has dozens upon dozens of potential encounters incorporating the monster-item-weapon formula. Strategy is key in this numbers game - know which move is the best at any given time to clear any dungeon you face!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884940/extras/4713aa140a8d15ef96e0cf1c223fca0a.avif?t=1767202961\" alt=\"DUNGEONS A PLENTY\" width=614 height=80 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Strategize to succeed!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See if you can clear set &quot;decks&quot;, holding true to this game's Scoundrel Solitaire roots. First take on a recreation of the classic, then take on more advanced decks that twist the core gameplay loop more and more with each successive challenge. With both a linear set of dungeons and a couple of hidden challenges, can you clear them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884940/extras/c20d1b4756591a07d35d1ecccc5cd7ef.avif?t=1767202961\" alt=\"THE GAUNTLET\" width=614 height=80 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Take on the eternal!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills in a randomly generated dungeon that never ends with over<strong>\u00a0140\u00a0</strong>different boons and banes to encounter. Try to clear as many encounters as you can before your health hits 0, with high scores, a seed system, different zones to uncover, and many rare secrets only in this mode!</p>","developers":["Vertacore Entertainment Solutions"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884940/8679c12fdc6fea7cf1c6793b228a1e71fdb6ef2d/header.jpg?t=1767202961","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3884940/346411504/8300936b3d01a3b8ef2cf879f44140f2f9b1a232/1767201818/dash_av1.mpd?t=1767202960","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3884940/346411504/8300936b3d01a3b8ef2cf879f44140f2f9b1a232/1767201818/dash_h264.mpd?t=1767202960","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3884940/346411504/8300936b3d01a3b8ef2cf879f44140f2f9b1a232/1767201818/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1767202960","id":257257477,"name":"Number Dungeon Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257257477/cc08ac874bc2f8e66adb9a52ad34f54da3